ng your reservations is the quickest way to build your Customer Score.","title":"Reliability"},"reservation_history":{"body":"How often you book and dine at TableCheck venues over time.","title":"Reservation history"},"transactions":{"body":"Completed bookings and spend through the platform.","title":"Transactions"},"venues_visited":{"body":"The number of different venues you make reservations at through TableCheck.","title":"Venues visited"}},"factors_intro":"Customer Score shows how you dine with TableCheck \u0026 is based on the following factors:","factors_title":"Score factors","faq":{"booking_block":{"answer":"Your score never blocks a reservation. Some venues may ask for a deposit or card guarantee before confirming.","question":"Can my score stop me booking?"},"data_used":{"answer":"Reservation history, venues visited, and completed transactions made through TableCheck. Nothing outside the platform is used.","question":"What data is used?"},"improve":{"answer":"Keep the bookings you make, arrive on time, and cancel early when plans change. Your score builds as completed reservations add up.","question":"How do I improve my score?"},"no_score":{"answer":"A score appears once you have completed a few bookings through TableCheck. Until then, restaurants simply see you as a new guest.","question":"Why don't I have a score?"},"no_show":{"answer":"No. A single no-show has a limited effect, and your score recovers as you keep the bookings that follow.","question":"Will one no-show ruin my score?"},"who_can_see":{"answer":"Only the restaurants you book with. They see your score when you make a reservation — never the details of where else you have dined.","question":"Who can see my score?"}},"faq_title":"FAQ","hero_image_alt":"A diner checking their customer score in the TableCheck app","hero_subtitle":"Use TableCheck, get rewarded.","hero_title":"Customer Score","how_title":"How does it work?","other_faqs_cta":"Other FAQs","perks":{"membership":"Access to membership","offers":"Offers \u0026 perks","venue_access":"Exclusive venue access"},"steps":{"avoid_cancel":{"body":"Last minute cancellations \u0026 no-shows may affect your score the most, try to avoid these.","title":"Avoid late cancellations"},"benefits":{"body":"Getting a higher score will earn you offers, perks \u0026 access to exclusive venues.","title":"Enjoy the benefits"},"book":{"body":"Completing reservations through TableCheck helps to build your customer score.","title":"Book on TableCheck"},"habits":{"body":"The more completed bookings you have, the more your score will increase over time.","title":"Keep consistent habits"}},"what_is_intro":"Your customer score reflects how reliably you keep the bookings you make, so restaurants can see at a glance that you're a guest they can count on. The higher your score climbs, the more perks you get, including:","what_is_title":"What is customer score?"},"guidance":{"frequency":{"complete_visits":"Complete {{required_actions}} more visits in the next 90 days to help improve your score."},"recency":{"come_back":"Book again within {{within_days}} days to help improve your score."},"reliability":{"complete_reservations":"Complete {{required_actions}} more bookings without cancelling to help improve your score."}},"insights":{"booking_frequency":{"description":"Booking more often through TableCheck raises this the fastest. \u003cactionLink\u003eFind a table\u003c/actionLink\u003e","title_value":"Recent booking: \u003cbold\u003e{{count}}\u003c/bold\u003e","title_value_plural":"Recent bookings: \u003cbold\u003e{{count}}\u003c/bold\u003e"},"improve_pill":"Improve your score","reliability":{"description":"Measures bookings you attend. Late cancellations and no-shows affect this most.","title_value":"Reliability rate: \u003cbold\u003e{{value}}\u003c/bold\u003e"},"transactions":{"description":"Deposits and payments made with TableCheck Pay count toward this. \u003cactionLink\u003eHow Pay works\u003c/actionLink\u003e","title_value":"Spend: \u003cbold\u003e{{value}}\u003c/bold\u003e"},"venues_visited":{"description":"Booking new venues through TableCheck raises this over time. \u003cactionLink\u003eExplore venues\u003c/actionLink\u003e","title_value":"Venue visited: \u003cbold\u003e{{count}}\u003c/bold\u003e","title_value_plural":"Venues visited: \u003cbold\u003e{{count}}\u003c/bold\u003e"}},"insights_period":"Last 12 months","insights_title":"Your score insights","levels":{"excellent":"Excellent","fair":"Fair","good":"Good","great":"Great","low":"Low"},"offers":{"book_with_offer":"Book with offer","claim_failed":"Couldn't claim this offer. Please try again.","code_copied":"Code copied","copy":"Copy","promo_code":"Promo code","select_venue":"Select venue"},"offers_title":"Offers \u0026 perks","overall_score":"Overall score","percentile":"Top {{percent}}%","perks":{"claim":"Claim","claimed":"Claimed","score_required":"{{level}} score required"},"status":{"inactive":{"description":"Your score is back once you complete another booking. It's calculated fresh each time, from your booking history."},"insufficient_history":{"description":"Your score appears once you've completed 5 bookings. Cancellations and no-shows don't count."},"score_suppressed":{"description":"Your score is back once you complete another booking. It's calculated fresh each time, from your booking history."},"unavailable":{"description":"We can't show your score right now. Try again shortly."}},"title":"Customer score","venue_diversity_levels":{"multi_venue":"Multi Venue","not_established":"Not Established","single_venue":"Single Venue"},"verify":{"code_input_label":"Verification code, digit {{index}}","code_resent":"Code sent","code_sent":"We have sent an SMS to \u003cstrong\u003e{{phone}}\u003c/strong\u003e. Enter the verification code below.","cta":"Send code","heading":"Available to users in Japan","invalid_code":"That code isn't right. Please try again.","japan_only":"Please enter a Japanese mobile number.","phone_verified"