"LearnMoreButton_lvv22mt btn"><svg focusable="false" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" fill="currentColor" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17 22 17 14 13 14 13 16 15 16 15 22 12 22 12 24 20 24 20 22 17 22z"></path><path d="M16,8a1.5,1.5,0,1,0,1.5,1.5A1.5,1.5,0,0,0,16,8Z"></path><path d="M16,30A14,14,0,1,1,30,16,14,14,0,0,1,16,30ZM16,4A12,12,0,1,0,28,16,12,12,0,0,0,16,4Z"></path></svg>Learn more</button><picture><source srcSet="https://2.image.cdn.tablecheck.com/unsafe/full-fit-in/100x100/smart/filters:format(webp)/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn0.tablecheck.com%2Fcommon%2Fimages%2Fapps%2Fdin%2Fv11.0.0%2Ftc-points-large.png 100w" type="image/webp"/><source srcSet="https://2.image.cdn.tablecheck.com/unsafe/full-fit-in/100x100/smart/filters:format(png)/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn0.tablecheck.com%2Fcommon%2Fimages%2Fapps%2Fdin%2Fv11.0.0%2Ftc-points-large.png 100w" type="image/png"/><img data-testid="TC Points Banner Icon" class="StyledSmartImage_suu27o4" src="https://2.image.cdn.tablecheck.com/unsafe/full-fit-in/smart/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn0.tablecheck.com%2Fcommon%2Fimages%2Fapps%2Fdin%2Fv11.0.0%2Ftc-points-large.png" alt="TC Points"/></picture><div class="ContentWrapper_cc7hm4n"><h5>Earn TC Points</h5><p class="Description_d1qqejtj"><span class="Text_t19dmqsf">Earn up to <strong>1%</strong> (max 5,000 points per person) rewards on bookings at this venue.</span></p></div></div></section><section data-testid="Venue Page Description" class="Wrapper_wqsm6z5"><h3>最高級のどぐろを心ゆくまで味わう専門店</h3><p class="DescriptionContent_d5numu6">「のどぐろ専門 銀座 中俣」は、大ぶりで脂のり抜群の最高級のどぐろを贅沢に味わえる専門店です。名物の塩焼きやしゃぶしゃぶ、一本丸ごと炊き上げる土鍋ご飯など、素材の魅力を引き出した多彩なのどぐろ料理をご提供。百余年の歴史を持つ中俣酒造の焼酎とともに、至福のひとときをお楽しみいただけます。和モダンな店内には個室も備え、接待や会食、記念日など幅広いシーンでご利用いただけます。</p></section></div><section data-testid="Menu Item Section" id="menu-items" class="ItemsSection_i177m1rk"><h3 data-testid="Menu Item Section Title">Featured menu</h3><section data-is-mobile="false" class="CardContainer_c1f